        "description": "Record the user's review/send decision on the prepared demand letter.\n\nThe connector only ever *prepares* the letter \u2014 the user approves and\nsends it. Statuses: `approved` (reviewed, ready to send),\n`sent-confirmed-by-user` (the user confirms they sent it).",
        "operationId": "api_letter_status_api_cases__cid__letter_status_post",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "cid",
            "in": "path",
            "required": true,
